@reactions event.ionStorm.escalation
// EW1 (events writer), the storm update: Saturday Day 13 (the surge at 11:20, storm stew, the lantern supper at 18:00).
? cue:event.ionStorm.escalation time:evening
- Lantern supper tonight. I've saved you a spot on the bench.   #warm
? cue:event.ionStorm.escalation dept:works weekday:sat
- Called in on a Saturday. The board doesn't know what a weekend is.
- My day off, they said. Then the surge, they said.   #funny

// EW2, the Veyli lore (plans/veyli-lore-plan.md section 3): Saruth at the lantern supper, the cord read by touch. The
// mess is lamp-lit on purpose: never tied to a blackout. Never the first knot (Holt's arc), never a rite.
? cue:event.ionStorm.escalation who:saruth place:mess time:evening
- On the long ship, when the lights failed, we read the cord by touch.
- Here. Hold it. Close your eyes. You can feel the months.   #warm
